---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---

<Base title="Cost per Agent · Agent Slot Calculator" description="Every machine on one chart: what one box costs over its life against what each agent slot on it costs, with market prices and your own listings.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <Header
      current="costs"
      title="Cost per agent vs. total cost"
      intro="Every machine on one chart: the report's picks, market listings and machines you add. Moving right costs more for the box; moving down costs less for each agent it carries. The best buys sit low on the chart at a total you can afford."
    />
    <div class="stack">
      <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="h-cost-chart">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <h2 id="h-cost-chart">Lifetime cost: per agent against per box</h2>
          <span class="eyebrow" id="cost-assume"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter machines">
          <div class="filter">
            <span class="eyebrow" id="f-cond-l">Condition</span>
            <div class="seg" role="group" aria-labelledby="f-cond-l" id="f-cond">
              <button type="button" data-v="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
              <button type="button" data-v="new" aria-pressed="false">New</button>
              <button type="button" data-v="used" aria-pressed="false">Used</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="filter">
            <label class="eyebrow" for="f-form">Type</label>
            <select id="f-form">
              <option value="all">All types</option>
              <option value="mini">Mini PCs</option>
              <option value="desktop">Desktops</option>
              <option value="big">Workstations and servers</option>
              <option value="mac">Macs</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="filter">
            <label class="eyebrow" for="f-ram">Memory</label>
            <select id="f-ram">
              <option value="0">Any</option>
              <option value="32">32 GB or more</option>
              <option value="64">64 GB or more</option>
              <option value="128">128 GB or more</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="filter">
            <label class="eyebrow" for="f-max">Box total up to</label>
            <span class="num"><span class="pre">$</span><input type="number" id="f-max" min="0" step="500" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="any"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row cost-controls">
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="show-owned" checked> Include machines you already own (power only)</label>
          <a class="text-link" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>Change settings in the calculator</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="legend" aria-label="Chart key">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="var(--accent)" /></svg>To buy</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="4.5" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" /></svg>Already yours</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 22 14" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="1" x2="21" y1="7" y2="7" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.55" /></svg>Lowest per-agent cost at each budget</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 22 14" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="1" x2="21" y1="12" y2="2" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 3" /></svg>Same number of agents</li>
          <li><span class="swatch" data-state="ok"></span>Within 10% of the cheapest per agent</li>
          <li><span class="swatch" data-state="warn"></span>Within 25%</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cost-chart" id="cost-chart-wrap">
          <svg id="cost-chart" role="group" aria-labelledby="h-cost-chart"></svg>
          <div class="tip" id="cost-tip" hidden></div>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Each dot is one machine under your settings. A dashed diagonal joins every total and per-agent cost that comes from the same number of agents, because per-agent cost is the box's total divided by its agents. Both axes are logarithmic. Hover over or focus a dot for its numbers.</p>
        <p class="note" id="cost-count" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </section>

      <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="h-cost-table">
        <div class="panel-head"><h2 id="h-cost-table">The numbers behind the chart</h2><span class="eyebrow">Cheapest box first</span></div>
        <div class="table-scroll">
          <table class="cost-table">
            <thead><tr>
              <th>Machine</th><th class="n" id="th-total">Total</th><th class="n">Agents</th><th class="n">Per agent</th><th class="n">vs. cheapest</th><th>Where the numbers come from</th>
            </tr></thead>
            <tbody id="cost-tbody"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="h-add">
        <div class="panel-head"><h2 id="h-add">Add a machine you found</h2><span class="eyebrow">Saved in this browser</span></div>
        <p class="hint">Pick the processor from the list and its PassMark scores fill in. For a processor that isn't listed, type its scores from cpubenchmark.net. Power is estimated from the processor and the type of machine.</p>
        <form id="add-form" class="add-form" novalidate>
          <div class="fields two">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="a-cpu">Processor</label>
              <input type="text" id="a-cpu" list="cpu-list" autocomplete="off" required placeholder="Intel Core i5-12500T">
              <datalist id="cpu-list"></datalist>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="a-name">Name <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
              <input type="text" id="a-name" autocomplete="off" placeholder="OptiPlex 7000 Micro from eBay">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="a-st">Single-thread score</label>
              <span class="num"><input type="number" id="a-st" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required><span class="unit">pts</span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="a-mt">Multi-thread score</label>
              <span class="num"><input type="number" id="a-mt" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required><span class="unit">pts</span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="a-ram">Memory</label>
              <span class="num"><input type="number" id="a-ram" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required><span class="unit">GB</span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="a-price">Price, all in</label>
              <span class="num"><span class="pre">$</span><input type="number" id="a-price" min="0" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required></span>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="a-cond">Condition</label>
              <select id="a-cond">
                <option value="used">Used</option>
                <option value="refurbished">Refurbished</option>
                <option value="new">New</option>
                <option value="owned">Already mine (power only)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="a-form">Machine type</label>
              <select id="a-form">
                <option value="mini">Mini PC</option>
                <option value="sff">Small desktop</option>
                <option value="tower">Desktop</option>
                <option value="workstation">Workstation</option>
                <option value="server">Server</option>
                <option value="mac">Mac</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="field span-2">
              <label for="a-link">Listing link <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
              <input type="url" id="a-link" autocomplete="off" placeholder="https://www.ebay.com/itm/…">
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="form-error" id="a-error" role="alert"></p>
          <div class="row">
            <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Add to the chart</button>
          </div>
        </form>
        <div class="yours">
          <div class="panel-head"><h3 id="h-yours">Your machines</h3>
            <div class="row">
              <button type="button" class="btn" id="export">Export</button>
              <label class="btn">Import<input type="file" id="import" accept="application/json,.json" class="visually-hidden"></label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="yours-list" id="yours-list" aria-labelledby="h-yours"></ul>
          <p class="note" id="yours-msg" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
    import '../../scripts/costs';
  </script>
</Base>
